        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Dibrugarh",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Dibrugarh's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Oil & Natural Gas sector in Dibrugarh demands components that perform reliably in Dibrugarh is the heart of India's oldest oil-producing region. OIL India's fields in Upper Assam and ONGC operations cre. We supply Alloy Steel F5/F11, Carbon Steel A105, SS 316 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
