      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Darbhanga",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Darbhanga's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Government Projects sector in Darbhanga demands components that perform reliably in Darbhanga's major upcoming AIIMS medical college project and irrigation infrastructure development create demand for uti. We supply Carbon Steel A105, SS 316L (medical grade) grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Darbhanga",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Darbhanga, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Government Projects and Agriculture Infrastructure sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Darbhanga's AIIMS Darbhanga (upcoming), we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Carbon Steel A105, SS 316L (medical grade) material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Darbhanga",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Darbhanga \u2014 especially in Government Projects and Agriculture Infrastructure \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Darbhanga meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Darbhanga's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Darbhanga",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Darbhanga and Bihar. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Government Projects applications in Darbhanga. From AIIMS Darbhanga (upcoming) to smaller project sites across Bihar, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
