    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Raipur",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Raipur's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Steel & Iron Manufacturing sector in Raipur demands components that perform reliably in Raipur is Chhattisgarh's industrial capital with one of India's densest steel re-rolling mill clusters. Demand is extrem. We supply Carbon Steel A105, Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91, SS 310S (high-temp) grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Raipur",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Raipur, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Steel & Iron Manufacturing and Power Generation sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Raipur's Bhilai Steel Plant (nearby), we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Carbon Steel A105, Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91, SS 310S (high-temp) material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Raipur",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Raipur \u2014 especially in Steel & Iron Manufacturing and Power Generation \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Raipur meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Raipur's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Raipur",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Raipur and Chhattisgarh. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Steel & Iron Manufacturing applications in Raipur. From Bhilai Steel Plant (nearby) to smaller project sites across Chhattisgarh, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
