        "q": "What types of flanges does Remax Forge supply to Ahmedabad?",
        "a": "Remax Forge supplies the complete range of ASME B16.5 and B16.47 flanges to Ahmedabad: Weld Neck (WNRF), Slip-On (SORF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges. For Ahmedabad's Chemical & Pharmaceutical sector, we particularly recommend SS 316L/317L (pharma) and Duplex 2205 material grades in Class 300 to 2500 ratings. All flanges comply with ASME B16.5 for sizes \u00bd\" to 24\" and B16.47 for 26\"\u201360\" large-bore applications."
