    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Rajkot",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Rajkot's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Engineering & Auto Components sector in Rajkot demands components that perform reliably in Rajkot is India's largest hub for small-scale engineering and auto component manufacturing. High volumes of carbon steel. We supply Carbon Steel A105/LF2, SS 304, Alloy Steel grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Rajkot",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Rajkot, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Engineering & Auto Components and Petroleum Equipment sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Rajkot's Rajkot GIDC, we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Carbon Steel A105/LF2, SS 304, Alloy Steel material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Rajkot",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Rajkot \u2014 especially in Engineering & Auto Components and Petroleum Equipment \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Rajkot meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Rajkot's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Rajkot",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Rajkot and Gujarat. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Engineering & Auto Components applications in Rajkot. From Rajkot GIDC to smaller project sites across Gujarat, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
