        "q": "What types of flanges does Remax Forge supply to Gandhinagar?",
        "a": "Remax Forge supplies the complete range of ASME B16.5 and B16.47 flanges to Gandhinagar: Weld Neck (WNRF), Slip-On (SORF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges. For Gandhinagar's Government & IT sector, we particularly recommend SS 316L and Carbon Steel A105 material grades in Class 300 to 2500 ratings. All flanges comply with ASME B16.5 for sizes \u00bd\" to 24\" and B16.47 for 26\"\u201360\" large-bore applications."
