        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Baddi's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Pharmaceutical Manufacturing sector in Baddi demands components that perform reliably in Baddi is India's #2 pharmaceutical manufacturing hub \u2014 home to Sun Pharma, Cipla, Cadila, and 600+ pharma units. Demand . We supply SS 316L/316 (pharma-grade), Hastelloy C-276, Duplex 2205 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
