    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Dhanbad",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Dhanbad's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Coal Mining sector in Dhanbad demands components that perform reliably in Dhanbad, India's 'Coal Capital', with BCCL's extensive coal mining and DVC's thermal power plants drives demand for heav. We supply Carbon Steel A105 (heavy-duty), Alloy Steel F11, Wear-Resistant Grades grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Dhanbad",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Dhanbad, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Coal Mining and Thermal Power sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Dhanbad's BCCL Coal Fields, we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Carbon Steel A105 (heavy-duty), Alloy Steel F11, Wear-Resistant Grades material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Dhanbad",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Dhanbad \u2014 especially in Coal Mining and Thermal Power \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Dhanbad meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Dhanbad's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Dhanbad",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Dhanbad and Jharkhand. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Coal Mining applications in Dhanbad. From BCCL Coal Fields to smaller project sites across Jharkhand, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
