    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Bengaluru",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Bengaluru's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Aerospace & Defense sector in Bengaluru demands components that perform reliably in Bangalore's aerospace sector (HAL, ISRO), defence manufacturing (BEML), and pharmaceutical companies in Bommasandra/Elec. We supply Inconel 625, SS 316L/317L, Duplex 2205, Titanium-adjacent grades grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Bengaluru",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Bengaluru, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Aerospace & Defense and Pharmaceutical & Chemical sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Bengaluru's HAL, we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Inconel 625, SS 316L/317L, Duplex 2205, Titanium-adjacent grades material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Bengaluru",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Bengaluru \u2014 especially in Aerospace & Defense and Pharmaceutical & Chemical \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Bengaluru meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Bengaluru's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Bengaluru",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Bengaluru and Karnataka. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Aerospace & Defense applications in Bengaluru. From HAL to smaller project sites across Karnataka, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
