    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Kollam",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Kollam's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Cashew Processing sector in Kollam demands components that perform reliably in Kollam's cashew processing industry \u2014 among the world's largest \u2014 requires food-grade SS fittings for processing plants,. We supply SS 304 (food-grade), Carbon Steel A105 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Kollam",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Kollam, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Cashew Processing and Port & Fishing sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Kollam's Kollam Port, we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in SS 304 (food-grade), Carbon Steel A105 material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Kollam",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Kollam \u2014 especially in Cashew Processing and Port & Fishing \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Kollam meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Kollam's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Kollam",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Kollam and Kerala. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Cashew Processing applications in Kollam. From Kollam Port to smaller project sites across Kerala, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
