    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Pune",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Pune's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Automobile & Engineering sector in Pune demands components that perform reliably in Pune's Chakan-Talegaon automotive corridor \u2014 India's largest \u2014 plus major pharma companies at Bhosari/Pimpri drive deman. We supply Carbon Steel A105, SS 316L/304L, Alloy Steel F11 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Pune",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Pune, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Automobile & Engineering and Pharmaceutical sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Pune's Chakan-Talegaon Auto Corridor, we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Carbon Steel A105, SS 316L/304L, Alloy Steel F11 material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Pune",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Pune \u2014 especially in Automobile & Engineering and Pharmaceutical \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Pune meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Pune's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Pune",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Pune and Maharashtra. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Automobile & Engineering applications in Pune. From Chakan-Talegaon Auto Corridor to smaller project sites across Maharashtra, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
