    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "What types of flanges does Remax Forge supply to Jodhpur?",
        "a": "Remax Forge supplies the complete range of ASME B16.5 and B16.47 flanges to Jodhpur: Weld Neck (WNRF), Slip-On (SORF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges. For Jodhpur's Petroleum & Defense sector, we particularly recommend Carbon Steel A105 and SS 316 material grades in Class 300 to 2500 ratings. All flanges comply with ASME B16.5 for sizes \u00bd\" to 24\" and B16.47 for 26\"\u201360\" large-bore applications."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which material grades are most suitable for Jodhpur's Petroleum & Defense industry?",
        "a": "For Jodhpur's Petroleum & Defense applications, we recommend: Carbon Steel A105, SS 316, Alloy Steel F5. For high-temperature services (above 400\u00b0C) in Jodhpur's Petroleum & Defense plants, Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91 grades are standard. For corrosive environments, SS 316L or Duplex 2205 is recommended. Our team provides free material selection consultancy for Jodhpur-based project requirements \u2014 contact us with your P&ID specifications."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Remax Forge supply IBR-approved flanges and fittings to Jodhpur?",
        "a": "Yes. Remax Forge & Fittings manufactures IBR (Indian Boiler Regulations) approved flanges and buttweld fittings for Jodhpur's boiler and pressure vessel applications. IBR compliance is mandatory for steam boilers operating above 3.5 kgf/cm\u00b2 in India. Our IBR-approved products include Weld Neck Flanges in A105, F11, F22, F91 grades, and Buttweld Elbows/Tees for steam lines. We supply IBR form II certificates with all applicable products dispatched to Jodhpur."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the typical delivery timeline for orders dispatched to Jodhpur?",
        "a": "Road via NH-62; 3-4 day delivery. For ex-stock items (standard sizes in A105, SS 304/316 grades), dispatch from Mumbai warehouse happens within 24-48 hours of order confirmation. Custom or special alloy orders typically require 7-15 working days for manufacturing. We coordinate with specialized freight partners for reliable delivery to Jodhpur and provide real-time shipment tracking. Contact our sales team at +91 97699 83108 for Jodhpur-specific lead time confirmation."
      },
      {
        "q": "What quality documentation do you provide with shipments to Jodhpur?",
        "a": "Every shipment to Jodhpur includes: (1) Mill Test Certificate (MTC) as per EN 10204 3.1 from NABL-accredited labs, (2) Dimensional Inspection Reports as per ASME B16.5/B16.47/B16.11, (3) Hydrostatic Test Certificates, (4) PMI (Positive Material Identification) reports by XRF analysis, (5) Heat Number traceability on all components, (6) Packing list with item-wise heat number mapping, (7) IBR Form II certificate (for applicable products). This complete traceability package is essential for EPC contractors and PSUs procuring for Jodhpur's regulated industries."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can Remax Forge customize flange dimensions or special alloys for Jodhpur projects?",
        "a": "Yes. Remax Forge's CNC precision machining facility handles custom forging requirements for Jodhpur's unique project specifications. We can manufacture: non-standard bore dimensions, special face finishes (RTJ ring grooves, Tongue & Groove, Male-Female), large-bore flanges beyond ASME B16.47 (up to 72\"), special alloys including Inconel 625, Hastelloy C-276, Monel 400, Super Duplex 32750/32760, and Alloy 20. Send us your drawing or specification and we will provide a quotation within 48 hours."
      }
    ],
