        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Agartala",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Agartala's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Natural Gas sector in Agartala demands components that perform reliably in Agartala is surrounded by Tripura's natural gas fields (ONGC). Gas processing and distribution infrastructure drives dem. We supply Carbon Steel A105/LF2, Alloy Steel F5/F11 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
