        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Kailashahar",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Kailashahar's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Government Infrastructure sector in Kailashahar demands components that perform reliably in Government infrastructure in Unakoti district.. We supply Carbon Steel A105 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
