        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Kanpur's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Leather & Chemical sector in Kanpur demands components that perform reliably in Kanpur's leather tanning and chemical industries drive demand for corrosion-resistant SS 316L/317L (chromium/acid enviro. We supply SS 317L/316L (chrome tannery), Hastelloy C-276, Carbon Steel A105 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
