        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Ghaziabad's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Engineering & Manufacturing sector in Ghaziabad demands components that perform reliably in Ghaziabad's Sahibabad industrial area \u2014 one of NCR's largest \u2014 hosts engineering, pharmaceutical, and chemical units. Hi. We supply Carbon Steel A105, SS 316L, Duplex 2205 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
