        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Roorkee",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Roorkee's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Engineering & Manufacturing sector in Roorkee demands components that perform reliably in Roorkee's proximity to BHEL Haridwar and IIT Roorkee's industrial research ecosystem drive demand for precision-engineer. We supply Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91 (IBR), Carbon Steel A105 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
