        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Roorkee",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Roorkee, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Engineering & Manufacturing and Power Infrastructure sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Roorkee's BHEL Haridwar (adjacent), we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91 (IBR), Carbon Steel A105 material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
