        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Haldwani",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Haldwani's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Trade & Distribution sector in Haldwani demands components that perform reliably in Haldwani is the gateway to Kumaon \u2014 a major distribution hub for industrial goods serving the hill districts. Demand for. We supply Carbon Steel A105, SS 304 grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
