    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Forged Fittings Manufacturer in Asansol",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is a premier Forged Fittings Manufacturer serving Asansol's industrial procurement needs. Our manufacturing facility \u2014 ISO 9001:2015 certified in Mumbai \u2014 produces high-pressure socket weld fittings, threaded fittings, and forged components that comply with ASME B16.11, ASTM A105, and relevant ASTM material specifications. The Steel & Coal sector in Asansol demands components that perform reliably in Asansol-Burnpur's IISCO steel plant and DVC Mejia power station (India's largest coal-based plant by installed capacity). We supply Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91, Carbon Steel A105, SS 310S grades \u2014 all with complete Mill Test Certificates (EN 10204 3.1) and third-party inspection reports. Every fitting undergoes Hydrostatic Testing, PMI, and Ultrasonic Testing before dispatch."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Flanges Supplier in Asansol",
        "content": "As an Industrial Flanges Supplier serving Asansol, Remax Forge provides the structural integrity that Steel & Coal and Power Generation sectors demand. Our product range spans Slip-On (SORF), Weld Neck (WNRF), Blind (BLRF), Socket Weld, Threaded, Lap Joint, Long Weld Neck, and Spectacle Blind flanges \u2014 all per ASME B16.5 and B16.47. For Asansol's Burnpur Steel (IISCO), we supply flanges in pressure classes from 150# to 2500#, in Alloy Steel F11/F22/F91, Carbon Steel A105, SS 310S material grades. Face types available: Raised Face (RF), Flat Face (FF), Ring Type Joint (RTJ), Tongue & Groove (T&G) and Male-Female (MF). All flanges are hydrostatically tested and shipped with NABL-accredited test reports."
      },
      {
        "title": "ISO Certified Quality Testing in Asansol",
        "content": "Industrial procurement teams in Asansol \u2014 especially in Steel & Coal and Power Generation \u2014 cannot compromise on quality compliance. Remax Forge's ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system ensures every component dispatched to Asansol meets ASME, ASTM, and applicable Indian standards. Our multi-stage testing protocol includes: Hydrostatic & Pneumatic Testing, Positive Material Identification (PMI) by XRF analyzer, Ultrasonic Testing (UT), Radiographic Testing (RT), Magnetic Particle Inspection (MPI), and Dye Penetrant Testing (DPT). Compliance documentation includes EN 10204 3.1 Mill Test Certificates, NACE MR0175 compliance certificates (for sour service), and IBR approval certificates where applicable for Asansol's boiler and pressure vessel applications."
      },
      {
        "title": "Industrial Piping Solutions Provider in Asansol",
        "content": "Remax Forge & Fittings is recognized as a reliable Industrial Piping Solutions Provider serving Asansol and West Bengal. Our Buttweld Fittings \u2014 elbows, reducers, tees, and caps \u2014 are engineered for Steel & Coal applications in Asansol. From Burnpur Steel (IISCO) to smaller project sites across West Bengal, our logistics network ensures your components arrive on time with complete traceability documentation."
      }
    ],
